<title>USA: LL&amp;E Royalty sets July distribution.</title>
<headline>LL&amp;E Royalty sets July distribution.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>		   Latest			Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.0278			   $0.0265</p>
<p> Pay		   July 15</p>
<p> Record		 July 7</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is LL&amp;E Royalty Trust. The distribution excludes proceeds from its Offshore Louisiana property, which still has to recover $700,000 in excess production costs, the trust said. It added it had escrowed $2.4 million for the property's future dismantle costs as of this month.</p>
</text>
